articles.summary:
MiniMax H3 is at @anyscalecompute’s #RaySummit today in SF.

@VictorSuOrtiz will break down our 33B open-weight audio-video model at the @vllm_project Conference, bringing text, image, video + audio into one context.

@VoidAsuka will share how builders are fine-tuning, evaluating + serving H3 alongside @digitalocean, @nvidia, @inferact, and @NousResearch.

From the model to the community building ...

